laced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"m2","requirement":"Python","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Engineer who likes dense passage ranking."},{"requirementId":"m3","requirement":"Postgres","cosine":0.63,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n1","requirement":"Embeddings pipeline","cosine":0.65,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},{"requirementId":"n2","requirement":"API design","cosine":0.62,"bestSentence":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."}]}},"seq":52,"ts":1793425281227},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"supervisor:SOURCE","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00153,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1768,"usage":{"input":13257,"output":354,"cacheRead":2737,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":53,"ts":1793425282997},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","kind":"reason","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":9,"text":"Profile describes replacing Elasticsearch with pgvector and HNSW indexes and tuning recall, which is substantive vector search work.","source":"llm"},"seq":54,"ts":1793425282998},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","kind":"tool_call","node":"cite_evidence","payload":{"n":9,"name":"cite_evidence","input":{"candidate_id":"c122","requirement_id":"m1","quote":"Projects: Replaced an Elasticsearch stack with pgvector and HNSW indexes, then tuned recall against a labelled set."},"phase":"SOURCE"},"seq":55,"ts":1793425282998},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt","kind":"llm","node":"llm","payload":{"purpose":"decide:requirement_support","cached":false,"costUsd":0.00008,"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","ms":1052,"usage":{"input":249,"output":108,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0}},"seq":56,"ts":1793425284064},{"runId":"run_mvvz3jjt